&lt;li&gt;Understanding of cloud security best practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working in Agile environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and spoken communication skills in French and English&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to have qualifications&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
